  "draft_py": "# FDN Vile Entomber: \"When this creature enters, search your library for a card, put that card\n# into your graveyard, then shuffle.\"  M21 Grim Tutor's search with the graveyard as destination;\n# SEARCH's controller role left out (divergence D12).\nentomb = TriggeredAbility(\n    event=ZoneChangeEvent(\n        from_zone=Zone(kind=ZoneKind.ANY, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),\n        to_zone=Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.YOU),\n        subject=FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.IS_SOURCE),\n    ),\n    condition=None,\n    effect=Seq(\n        steps=(\n            A(Verb.SEARCH, {\n                'cards': Selector(\n                    count=QConst(value=1),\n                    mode=SelectorMode.CHOOSE,\n                    filter=FAnd(children=()),\n                    zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.LIBRARY, controller=ControllerRef.YOU),),\n                ),\n                'destination': Zone(kind=ZoneKind.GRAVEYARD, controller=ControllerRef.YOU),\n            }),\n            A(Verb.SHUFFLE, {'zone': Zone(kind=ZoneKind.LIBRARY, controller=ControllerRef.YOU)}),\n        ),\n    ),\n)\nabilities = [entomb, *compiled]\n",
